## Non-negotiable Rules (read before touching any file)

1. Run `flutter analyze` before finishing **any** task — zero warnings allowed.
2. Follow `.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc` for all structural decisions.
3. Follow `.cursor/rules/karpathy.mdc` for all coding behavior.
4. Append a learning entry to `.cursor/skills/add-feature/learned/README.md` after every feature task.

## Stack

| Concern | Library |
|---------|---------|
| State | Riverpod 3 (`@riverpod` annotations) |
| Routing | go_router |
| Networking | Dio + AuthInterceptor |
| Secure storage | flutter_secure_storage |
| Logging | Talker |
| UI | Material 3 — no custom tokens |

## Key Files

- `lib/main.dart` — entry point; `ProviderScope` wraps `MaterialApp.router`
- `lib/core/router/app_router.dart` — GoRouter; add routes here
- `lib/core/di/providers.dart` — app-wide singleton providers
- `lib/core/network/dio_client.dart` — Dio + interceptors setup
- `lib/core/constants/app_constants.dart` — compile-time constants (baseUrl, etc.)

